<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed  lower in active trading on Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average fell 28.57 to 8,194.04. For the week,  the Dow rose 80.60 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 3.52 to 490.98.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down 33 cents.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 1,827 to 1,043.</p>
<p>Volume was 511,634,810, compared with 547,827,670 Thursday. Weekly  volume totalled 2,649,184,810 shares.</p>
